## Model card

- **Claimed name:** Claude Opus 4.4 (folder slug `claude-opus-4.4`, id `opencode/claude-opus-4.4`).
- **Finding:** Anthropic has never released a Claude Opus 4.4. The Opus 4.x line goes 4 → 4.1 → 4.5 → 4.6 → 4.7 → 4.8 → 5 → 5.5; there is no 4.2, 4.3 or 4.4 in any first-party source. The folder's placeholder meta ("128K total", "Text in/out", "Standard pricing") matches the generic scaffold, not any real spec.
- **Context window / modalities / pricing:** unknown — the model does not exist.
- **Access:** not served on OpenCode Zen (live catalogue lists `claude-opus-4-5`, `claude-opus-4-6`, `claude-opus-4-7`, `claude-opus-4-8`, `claude-opus-5`, `claude-opus-5-5`, `claude-opus-5-5-backup` — no 4.4). `opencode/claude-opus-4.4` therefore resolves to no route.

### Raw benchmarks found

- No verified public benchmark score found for Claude Opus 4.4 in any first-party or independent source: no Anthropic model page, no system card, no API id, no pricing row, no Artificial Analysis / Epoch AI / Vals AI / SWE-bench row.

