Result: No first-party Anthropic page, system card, API id, pricing row, or independent aggregator (Artificial Analysis, BenchLM, Epoch AI, Vals AI, SWE-bench) entry for "Claude Opus 4.4" exists. Live OpenCode Zen catalogue (models.dev, 132 models) contains no `claude-opus-4.4` / `claude-opus-4-4` route. Conclusion unchanged: no verified model; scores withheld rather than fabricated.

